"entity": {
"name": "NatWest Group Plc",
"description": "NatWest Group Plc engages in the provision of international banking and financial services. It operates through the following segments: Retail Banking, Private Banking, Commercial and Institutional, and Central Items and Other. The Retail Banking segment provides a comprehensive range of banking products and related financial services including current accounts, mortgages, personal unsecured lending, and personal deposits. The Private Banking segment focuses on the private banking and wealth management services to UK-connected high-net-worth individuals. The Commercial and Institutional segment includes expertise and tailored solutions needed by businesses, from entrepreneurs through to large corporate organizations. The Central Items and Other segment refer to the corporate functions, such as treasury, finance, risk management, compliance, legal, communications and human resources. The company was founded on March 25, 1968 and is headquartered in Edinburgh, the United Kingdom.",
